 r←tno CanBeSaved value
⍝ Returns 1 when `value` can be written to a component file and 0 otherwise. An instance of a class or a GUI
⍝ object cannot, and neither can an array that contains one.\\
⍝ `tno` is the tie number of a component file used for trying; the component is removed again.
 :Trap 1 11                                     ⍝ WS FULL and DOMAIN ERROR
     value ⎕FAPPEND tno
     ⎕FDROP tno ¯1
     r←1
 :Else
     r←0
 :EndTrap
